  "cards": [
    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "Inside the web service", "items": [
      "entrypoint.sh runs alembic upgrade, then gunicorn with uvicorn workers",
      "Staff pages and their /api calls all pass the sign-in check; each router adds its own permission",
      "The weekly brief and automation loops run inside the same process, started at boot"
    ] },
    { "dot": "violet", "title": "Field bot", "items": [
      "The webhook only checks Telegram's secret and stores the update; the sweep processes it",
      "Each message becomes a draft in PostgreSQL that a manager reviews",
      "Voice notes go to a separate transcription provider (Groq)"
    ] },
    { "dot": "amber", "title": "Worth knowing", "items": [
      "Redis is connected at startup, but no module reads or writes the cache",
      "The backup runs as its own Railway cron service, not in the web app"
    ] }
  ]
